@startuml
!include _style.iuml
|BIM Engineer|
start
:Request comparison of base
and target versions;
|Constructs API|
if (Same model group and both
versions READY?) then (no)
  :Reject request (400 / 409);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Load elements of both versions
keyed by IFC GlobalId;
:Missing in target -> REMOVED
New in target -> ADDED;
:Present in both: compare hashes of
properties, quantities, placement,
geometry and identity fields;
:Changed -> MODIFIED
(MOVED when storey, space or
placement changed);
:Severity HIGH for structural
classes with geometry or
location change;
repeat :For each change record;
  if (Element linked to a task,
issue or milestone?) then (yes)
    :Impact suggestion on the linked
item (confidence 1.0);
  else (no)
    :DISCIPLINE_REVIEW suggestions on
up to 20 tasks of the same
discipline (confidence 0.65);
  endif
repeat while (More changes?) is (yes)
-> no;
:Store summary, notify project
manager, write audit log;
|Project Manager|
:Acknowledge or dismiss each
impact suggestion (audited);
:Update affected tasks or
raise issues where needed;
stop
@enduml
